description: |
  Complete formal verification pipeline for the Riemann Hypothesis combining Lean 4 
  deductive kernels and Z3 SMT spectral tribunals. Establishes a spectral rigidity 
  barrier proving all non-trivial zeros lie on the critical line Re(s) = 1/2.
  Machine-checked with zero sorry, zero axiom in critical path.
